# Empty on purpose. During the lab you will be asked whether any of the
# dependency findings should be ignored here, and what a defensible ignore
# entry must contain.
#
# The shape of an entry, for reference:
#
#   ignore:
#     SNYK-JAVA-ORGAPACHECOMMONS-2841885:
#       - '*':
#           reason: >
#             Not reachable - no StringSubstitutor call exists in this
#             codebase. Verified at build 1.0.0-TRAINING by source search.
#           expires: 2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z
#
# Note that 'reason' and 'expires' are both required for the entry to be
# defensible. An ignore with neither is a suppression, not a decision.

